{"step_index":1335,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T14:58:31Z","thinking":"**Discovering Tomcat's CORS Capability**\n\nTomcat exhibits dynamic CORS behavior, mirroring the `Origin` header in `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` and enabling credentials.  This observation implies Tomcat natively supports CORS.  Nginx was being used for this functionality, but now Tomcat seems to be handling it.\n\n\n**Identifying CORS Configuration Conflicts**\n\nThe Nginx configuration introduces conflicting CORS headers. The manual `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` directive overrides Tomcat's CORS, and is incompatible with `Allow-Credentials: true`. This likely causes browser security violations. The solution involves removing the manual CORS headers from the configuration file.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"/home/koby/.ansible/kssh th2-revproxyp-fe1 'cat << \\\"EOF\\\" | sudo tee /etc/nginx/sites-available/03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf\\n# HTTPS Centreon MAP\\nserver {\\n    listen              172.30.198.33:9443 ssl http2;\\n    listen              109.62.64.18:9443 ssl http2;\\n    server_name         map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr 109.62.64.18;\\n\\n    # SSL (certificat dédié Let'\\\\''s Encrypt)\\n    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/fullchain.pem;\\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/privkey.pem;\\n\\n    # security\\n    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;\\n\\n    # logging\\n    access_log          /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-access.log;\\n    error_log           /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-error.log warn;\\n\\n    # Redirection explicite racine -> /centreon-map/\\n    location = / {\\n        return 301 /centreon-map/;\\n    }\\n\\n    # reverse proxy vers Map (Tomcat HTTPS sur port 9443)\\n    location / {\\n        proxy_pass                 https://172.30.198.50:9443;\\n        proxy_ssl_verify           off;\\n\\n        # Protocol & keepalive\\n        proxy_http_version         1.1;\\n        proxy_cache_bypass         $http_upgrade;\\n        proxy_set_header Upgrade   $http_upgrade;\\n        proxy_set_header Connection $connection_upgrade;\\n\\n        # Proxy headers (single definition per header to comply with RFC 7230)\\n        proxy_set_header Host              $http_host;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP         $remote_addr;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For   $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Ssl   on;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Host  $host;\\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Port  9443;\\n\\n        # Timeouts\\n        proxy_connect_timeout      60s;\\n        proxy_send_timeout         60s;\\n        proxy_read_timeout         60s;\\n\\n  \n<truncated 365 bytes>","Cwd":"\"/home/koby\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Updating 03-map config and reloading Nginx\"","toolSummary":"\"Remove manual CORS from Nginx\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
